## At a glance

| Piece | Rule |
|--------|------|
| **Where to send** | **`AskQuestion`** — known team channels (see [Destination (Slack)](#destination-slack)), DM, reviewers, or **other**. |
| **Headline** | **`Ready for review: 👀`** (literal emoji U+1F440) |
| **PR** | **`PR: `** + full GitHub PR URL, **one line** |
| **Task** | **`Task: `** + `https://vendoroo-dev.atlassian.net/browse/<KEY>` (from branch **`VAP-\d+`** or user), **one line** |
| **Summary** | **`Summary: `** + **1–2** outcome sentences (from PR title/body/commits), **plain text**, no checklist noise |
| **Calendar note** | Add one short sentence: **`:calendar: PR review meeting is already on your calendar. Please check it.`** — **only when** the user confirmed the meeting exists (see **Prerequisite — Google Calendar** below) |
| **Reviewers** | **No `Reviewers:` label** — only **`<@USER_ID>, …`** (or plain fallbacks / see edge cases) |
| **After send** | Ask confirmation, then **Jira required fields** checklist before In Review transition |
| **Spacing (MCP)** | **`\n\n`** between headline, **`PR:`**, **`Task:`**, **`Summary:`**, optional calendar line, and mentions line |
| **Glue fix** | If **`Task:`** sticks to **`PR:`**, prefix **`Task:`** with **`\u200b`** |

