## Field reference

| Field | Source / rule |
|--------|----------------|
| **`PR:`** | **`gh pr view <n> --json url -q .url`** (or current branch). Use the repo’s real **`html_url`** from GitHub (not a guessed host). |
| **`Task:`** | **`https://vendoroo-dev.atlassian.net/browse/<KEY>`**. **`KEY`** from branch **`VAP-\d+`**, else user, else first ticket in PR body, else **`(no Jira key — add link manually)`**. |
| **`Summary:`** | Compressed outcome from **`title`**, **Description** (human prose only), **`commits[].messageHeadline`**. |
| **Mentions** | **`slack_search_users`** → **`<@USER_ID>`**; see **Resolving reviewers** for teams and fallbacks. |

